# unit_car_crash_08: a car's crash 08:A034 (CarCrashParts), which sheds a
# car's six parts by its model (+$27), as calls on object 1 ($2001) from a
# Novice race's state: each of the eight models it knows and one it does
# not, the flags in A (bit 0: hit, the first part knocked off at once;
# bit 1: a 20-frame life) on each of the four part sets, with no free
# object ($0CEE = $2E) or only one (the free list cut after its first
# record at $7E:4FDB), with the first record pool
# emptied ($70:1098), and the car already crashed (+$25 bit 2 or 7).
load build/stuntracefx/states/novice_coupe_race1.state
set 7E2028 B9,81
call 08:A034 long a=0000 x=0001 p=20 db=7E d=0000
load build/stuntracefx/states/novice_coupe_race1.state
set 7E2028 B9,81
